    "de": [
      "Traditionelle Küche vom Ufer der Saône und regionale Spezialitäten in einer wunderschönen Umgebung am Wasser (Friture, frische Frösche)."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Traditional cuisine from the banks of the Saône and regional specialities in a magnificent setting by the water (Frying, fresh frogs)."
    ],
    "it": [
